{"step_index":2841,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T12:59:20Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough of dynamic Excel summary formulas, review toast fix, re-run progress modal overlay, pharmaceutical prompt rules, and production deployment package.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Dynamic Summary Formulas, Review Real-time Sync, Global Progress Modal & Production Deployment\n\nAll requested enhancements, bug fixes, and production packaging have been implemented and verified end-to-end.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Dynamic Excel Summary Formulas (`ملخص`)\n- **Implemented Dynamic Formulas**:\n  - `إجمالي الأصناف المطلوبة`: `=B3+B4+B5`\n  - `تم مطابقتها`: `=SUM(B8:B{7+N})` (sums warehouse matched counts)\n  - `لم يُعثر عليها`: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('لم يُعثر عليه'!A:A)-1)`\n  - `تحتاج مراجعة`: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('يحتاج مراجعة'!A:A)-1)`\n  - Warehouse details table (rows 8+):\n    - Col 2: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('{sheet}'!A:A)-1)`\n    - Col 3: `=COUNTIF('يحتاج مراجعة'!D:D, \"{warehouse_name}\")`\n  - Percentages formatted dynamically with `=IF(B2>0, B3/B2, 0)` and formatted as `0.0%`.\n- **Confidence Values in Arabic**:\n  - Replaced technical codes (`exact`, `high`, `llm`) with professional Arabic terms:\n    - `تطابق تام (100%)`\n    - `تطابق نصي دقيق (X%)`\n    - `مطابقة ذكية (AI)`\n    - `تأكيد يدوي (مراجعة)`\n\n---\n\n## 2. Review Workflow & UI Synchronization\n- **Fixed Toast Message (`undefined` bug)**:\n  - Fixed toast message in `applyReviews()`: now clearly shows:\n    `تم تنفيذ التعديلات! تم اعتماد: X مطابق، Y غير متوفر، والمتبقي للمراجعة: Z`.\n- **Instant Stat Cards Refresh**:\n  - `backend.apply_reviews` now returns `new_stats` (`total`, `matched_count`, `not_found_count`, `review_count`).\n  - Calls `loadResults(result.new_stats)` so the 4 stat cards update on screen immediately without leaving the screen.\n- **Excel Synchronization**:\n  - `apply_reviews` updates the `ملخص` sheet cells, updates `history.db`, and saves the workbook cleanly.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Global Re-Run Modal Overlay & Concurrency Lock\n- **Global Modal Overlay**:\n  - Moved `#progress-modal` from inside `screen-new` to a fixed full-screen backdrop overlay (`position: fixed; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; z-index: 99999;`).\n  - When clicking \"إعادة المطابقة (Re-run)\" from the results screen, the modal pops up immediately over the screen with a live timer, progress bar, and spinner.\n  - Added a button inside the modal allowing the user to view the Terminal logs if desired.\n- **Concurrency Protection**:\n  - Added `isProcessRunning` state check in frontend: prevents clicking \"بدء عملية المطابقة\" while a process is running.\n  - Added thread lock `self._worker_lock` and running check in backend: `start_process`, `restart_process`, and `rerun_process` will safely reject concurrent runs with a clear warning.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Pharmaceutical Rules Tuning in AI Prompt\n- **Brand vs Generic / Alternative Substitution**:\n  - Drugs with the same active ingredient and strength but different trade names (e.g. Roaccutane vs generic Isotretinoin, or Zovirax vs Lovir) are now correctly routed to **\"يحتاج مراجعة\"** with the reason:\n    `\"بديل تجاري / مثيل: نفس المادة الفعالة والتركيز ولكن الاسم التجاري مختلف (المطلوب: [اسم]، المتوفر: [اسم])\"`.\n- **Identical Counts / Manufacturer Suffix**:\n  - Equal counts (e.g. 3 ampoules == ٣ امبولات) and items where the only difference is the manufacturer suffix (`/نوفارتس`, `/اكاديميا`) are now recognized as **100% confirmed matches** instead of going to review.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Production Packaging (`dist_production/`)\n- Created `scripts/package_production.py` which builds a clean, standalone distribution in `dist_production/`:\n  - Contains only runtime files (`desktop_app/`, `src/`, `fast_main.py`, `requirements.txt`, `.env.example`).\n  - Contains fresh, clean `data/` directory with initialized `history.db`.\n  - Includes `run_app.bat` (1-click Windows launcher that auto-installs requirements and starts the app).\n  - Includes `README_SETUP.md` with complete, easy-to-follow Arabic setup instructions for the pharmacy computer.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Verification Results\n\n| Component / Test | Result |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Excel Summary Formulas** | PASSED: Dynamic Excel formulas `=B3+B4+B5`, `=SUM(...)`, `=COUNTA(...)` generated and verified |\n| **Confidence Arabic Names** | PASSED: Shows `تطابق تام (100%)`, `تطابق نصي دقيق (97%)`, `مطابقة ذكية (AI)` |\n| **Review Sync & Toast** | PASSED: Returns `new_stats`, updates cards instantly, no `undefined` in toast |\n| **Brand vs Generic Routing** | PASSED: Roaccutane vs Isotretinoin, Zovirax vs Lovir routed to `يحتاج مراجعة` with Arabic reason |\n| **Identical Count Matching** | PASSED: Voltaren 3 ampoules / Novartis matched directly |\n| **Concurrency Protection** | PASSED: Concurrent process execution blocked in backend and UI |\n| **Production Packaging** | PASSED: Standalone `dist_production/` folder created with `run_app.bat` and `README_SETUP.md` |\n","Description":"Walkthrough artifact of all implemented changes and test results","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing walkthrough artifact","toolSummary":"Create walkthrough.md"}}]}
